Package: tidyproteomics
Title: S3 Data Object and Framework for Common Quantitative Proteomic Analyses
Version: 1.9.15
Authors@R: 
    person("Jeff", "Jones", , "jeffj@caltech.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    Creates a simple, universal S3 data structure for the post-analysis
    of mass spectrometry-based quantitative proteomic data. In
    addition, this package collects, adapts and organizes several useful
    algorithms and methods used in typical post-analysis workflows.
